{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":43.72999954223633,"text":"At the southwestern edge of the island, a rock rises sharply, 236 meters above the sea, with nothing at all around it. The name of the village Olo says it exactly, Monolithos, one stone. In the 15th century, the knights built a castle on the summit, and their design was almost lazy in the good sense. They hardly had to build any wall at all, because the rock is already vertical on every side. There is one path up, and only one. Inside the castle today, there are no barracks and no halls, only a small whitewashed chapel. The view from the top reaches the next headland, and you understand at once what the guards could see, and why they chose this lonely stone.","words":[{"word":"At","start":0,"end":0.5799999833106995},{"word":"the","start":0.5799999833106995,"end":0.8199999928474426},{"word":"southwestern","start":0.8199999928474426,"end":1.6799999475479126},{"word":"edge","start":1.6799999475479126,"end":1.7000000476837158},{"word":"of","start":1.7000000476837158,"end":2.380000114440918},{"word":"the","start":2.380000114440918,"end":2.380000114440918},{"word":"island","start":2.380000114440918,"end":2.380000114440918},{"word":"a","start":2.680000066757202,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"rock","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.0199999809265137},{"word":"rises","start":3.0199999809265137,"end":3.440000057220459},{"word":"sharply","start":3.440000057220459,"end":3.9800000190734863},{"word":"236","start":4.800000190734863,"end":5.820000171661377},{"word":"meters","start":5.820000171661377,"end":6.139999866485596},{"word":"above","start":6.139999866485596,"end":6.420000076293945},{"word":"the","start":6.420000076293945,"end":6.800000190734863},{"word":"sea","start":6.800000190734863,"end":6.900000095367432},{"word":"with","start":7.199999809265137,"end":7.480000019073486},{"word":"nothing","start":7.480000019073486,"end":7.679999828338623},{"word":"at","start":7.679999828338623,"end":8.1400